  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:59:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. I would like to inquire about a sidewalk problem. Is this the correct department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got it. What's going on with the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The slabs have heaved up, and there is a raised edge. I tripped on it this morning. I was not badly hurt, but I would like it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry to hear that. Okay, heaved sidewalk, a trip hazard. Where is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 376 Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you're breaking up a little. Three seventy-six Bellevue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Could you please speak up? I can barely hear you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, is that better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:58:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I apologize, I meant softer. You are quite loud now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. How's this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So Bellevue, sidewalk heaved, you tripped. Anything else I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That stretch is on a bus route, so many people walk there. I would like to ask that the street be added to the repair list, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, I'll put it down for the sidewalk repair list and flag the bus route. Do you want a callback number on this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 401-555-0151. You're all set, Ms. Vieira."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:59:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
